トさせてください。\n\n（以下に個人的な希望を記しますが、基本全面的に敗北様のセンスにお任せします）\n・忍転身衣装（下乳見えてるver）、但し白衣は無しを希望いたします。\n・衣装お胸の片方の部分をぺろっとめくって乳首チラして、悪戯げに誘惑してくださると嬉しいです♪\n参考資料URL\nhttps://www.marv.jp/special/game/vita/kaguraversus/character/haruka.html\n\nこれからもご活躍を応援しております！", "nc": 177, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@1haiboku/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1552456, "client_id": 1351280, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/edba22df/uploads/origins/d3c5bc38-6985-49ec-a996-80cb0838e810?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0031e5ff1f2c85f024d4e3232fbbfc41", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/edba22df/uploads/origins/d3c5bc38-6985-49ec-a996-80cb0838e810?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0031e5ff1f2c85f024d4e3232fbbfc41, https://si.imgix.net/edba22df/uploads/origins/d3c5bc38-6985-49ec-a996-80cb0838e810?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4c8553cdfad843955bf62b4ee4f98d6d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/edba22df/uploads/origins/d3c5bc38-6985-49ec-a996-80cb0838e810?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ebaadddfbc0baeae33c9041d249e4b2f 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/edba22df/uploads/origins/d3c5bc38-6985-49ec-a996-80cb0838e810?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=63ebd3181e9f2473a7431b57704cd104", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/edba22df/uploads/origins/d3c5bc38-6985-49ec-a996-80cb0838e810?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=63ebd3181e9f2473a7431b57704cd104, https://si.imgix.net/edba22df/uploads/origins/d3c5bc38-6985-49ec-a996-80cb0838e810?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=2